# The push harness's cache: the request bodies it has already sent for a revision, so a retry can reuse
# the bytes rather than rebuild them. Local state by construction — its contents are a function of what
# this machine has already pushed and name no artifact of the repository — and it was UNTRACKED until
# iteration 98 staged it by accident with a pathspec that excluded `docs` and nothing else.
.bench-cache/
benchmark-results/
artifacts/
*.log
